  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing equitable, climate-resilient and sustainable SSF through the SSF Guidelines implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to building an enabling environment that allows all ? including vulnerable and marginalised groups, Indigenous Peoples, women and youth ? to benefit from sustainable small-scale fisheries based on SSF Guidelines implementation. This will include strengthening the role of small-scale fishing communities as resource stewards and as actively contributing to climate change adaptation solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
